[ransomleak_assign_training]
param.account = <list> Account. It's a required parameter.
param.exercise_slug = <string> Exercise slug. It's a required parameter.
param.email_field = <string> Email field. It's a required parameter. It's default value is userEmail.
param.reassign_period = <list> Re-assign after. It's a required parameter. It's default value is never.
param.max_assignments = <string> Maximum assignments per firing. It's a required parameter. It's default value is 100.
python.required = {3.7|3.9|3.13}
* For Python scripts only, selects which Python version to use.
* Set to "3.9" to use the Python 3.9 version.
* Set to "3.13" to use the Python 3.13 version.
* Optional.
* Default: not set
